            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 328-180(3)(a) (note)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the note, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-4" marker="4">
                  <content>
                    <p>Note:	This threshold is $20,000, $25,000 or $30,000 for costs included between 12 May 2015 and 30 June 2020: see subsection 328-180(5) of the <i>Income Tax (Transitional Provisions) Act 1997</i>.</p>
                  </content>
