              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-5" marker="5">
                  <content>
                    <p>Note 2:	This threshold is $20,000, $25,000 or $30,000 for income years ending on or after 12 May 2015 and on or before 30 June 2020: see subsection 328-180(6) of the <i>Income Tax (Transitional Provisions) Act 1997</i>.</p>
