                    <p>Note:	Instead of $1,000, the threshold in subsection 328-180(1) may be $20,000, $25,000 or $30,000 for assets first acquired between 12 May 2015 and 30 June 2020: see subsection 328-180(4) of the <i>Income Tax (Transitional Provisions) Act 1997</i>.</p>
                  </content>
